    Using $R = 8.314 \mathrm{~J} \mathrm{~mol}^{-1} \mathrm{~K}^{-1}$ and $C_{V,m} = 28.8 \mathrm{~J} \mathrm{~K}^{-1} \mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$:
    $$\gamma = 1 + \frac{8.314}{28.8} \approx 1 + 0.288 \approx 1.288$$

