$\binom{5}{3} 2^8 = 10 \cdot 256 = 2560$
$\binom{5}{4} 1^8 = 5 \cdot 1 = 5$
$\binom{5}{5} 0^8 = 1 \cdot 0 = 0$

Sum $= 390625 - 327680 + 65610 - 2560 + 5 - 0$
